	There's a secret door on the far side of the fort.  It's the only way
in that I know of.  How to cross the moat is up to you.  If you've got another
boulder, that'd work best.

>Also, I did not find anything special in the Gnomish Mines (luck stone).  Do
>I need to go back down them again and have a search for a hidden room or
>something....

	There are two secret rooms in the lowest level of the mines.  There is
a luckstone and a pile of other gems in the second one.

>Finally, I have been given my Quest, (Barbarian), but on level (21?) there is
>a lot of water everywhere, and I can't teleport (not that I have control
>yet).  DoI need to somehow find something to make me levitate or walk on
>water?  If so, what would be the best way of going about it.

	It sounds as though you've discovered the Medusa's level on 21.  You
will definitely need levitation, water walking, or magical breathing to cross,
as teleporting is not allowed there.  I am guessing that you haven't completed
your quest.  If that is true, do so.  Once you have the Heart of Ahriman (the
Barbarian quest item), you will be able to levitate more or less at will by
#invoking the Heart.

